5PM EDT by NWS Key West FL","description":"SMWKEY\n\nThe National Weather Service in Key West has issued a\n\n* Special Marine Warning for...\nHawk Channel and Straits of Florida from Ocean Reef to west end of\nSeven Mile Bridge out 20 nm...\nBayside and Gulf side from Craig Key to west end of Seven Mile\nBridge...\nFlorida Bay including Barnes Sound, Blackwater Sound, and\nButtonwood Sound...\n\n* Until 445 PM EDT.\n\n* At 418 PM EDT, a strong thunderstorm was located over Eagle Wreck,\nmoving west at 15 knots.\n\nHAZARD...Wind gusts 34 knots or greater.\n\nSOURCE...National Weather Service Meteorologist.\n\nIMPACT...Expect wind gusts in excess of 34 knots, suddenly higher\nwaves, frequent lightning, and heavy downpours.\n\n* Locations in the warning include...\nEagle Wreck, Craig Key, Boy Scouts Florida Sea Base, Alligator Reef\nLight, and Tennessee Reef Light.","instruction":"Intense and continuous lightning is occurring with this storm. Stay\nlow, or go below. Lower VHF antenna, outriggers, fishing rods, and\numbrellas.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["SMWKEY"],"WMOidentifier":["WHUS52 KKEY 182018"],"eventMotionDescription":["2026-10-18T20:18:00-00:00...storm...068DEG...14KT...24.82,-80.56"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.NEW.KKEY.MA.W.0333.261018T2018Z-261018T2045Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-10-18T16:45:00-04:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["SMW"],"NationalWeatherService":["MAW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.b03f3db7c7390b280878b80c4c7ed59358c197d0.001.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-81.84,31.29],[-81.83,31.14],[-81.9,31.14],[-81.91,31.28],[-81.84,31.29]]]},"properties":{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.b03f3db7c7390b280878b80c4c7ed59358c197d0.001.1","@type":"wx:Alert","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.b03f3db7c7390b28087